  "summary": "长度为二的幂的数组每轮缩半，新数组偶数位置取对应一对最小值，奇数位置取最大值，直到一个数。",
  "insight": "可在原数组前半原地写下一轮：i 偶数取 nums[2i],nums[2i+1] 的最小，i 奇数取最大，活动长度减半。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "奇偶判断是新数组下标 i",
    "输入长度保证二的幂",
    "单元素直接返回"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "in-place-round-reduction",
      "title": "原地逐轮缩半",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "用数组前缀承载每轮新状态。",
      "steps": [
        "length=nums.length",
        "while length>1：nextLength=length/2，i 遍历，按 i 奇偶写 nums[i]",
        "length=nextLength；返回 nums[0]"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n)",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/in-place-round-reduction/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/in-place-round-reduction/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/in-place-round-reduction/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
